      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "-Yl52uVvQdXg72tR5C2p_",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 371.2083441442334,
      "y": 271.70584835114425,
      "width": 260.25,
      "height": 37.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "ac",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 613661398,
      "version": 83,
      "versionNonce": 33971734,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1771775550536,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "实际金属价值 < 面值时，劣币出现\n当实际金属价值 > 面值时，良币被藏匿",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "实际金属价值 < 面值时，劣币出现\n当实际金属价值 > 面值时，良币被藏匿",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "e_jCp4Wl0QjdooJ2Sr5tY",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 188.86239632383052,
      "y": 338.70194833175645,
      "width": 624.94189453125,
      "height": 56.25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "af",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2079321930,
      "version": 116,
      "versionNonce": 1907177354,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1771775827898,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "收到良币（金属值钱） → 倾向收藏、熔化、输出国外、囤积（因为卖金属本身就能赚更多）。\n收到劣币（金属不值钱） → 尽快花出去（反正面值一样，用掉最划算）。\n结果：市场上只剩下劣币流通，良币消失（被“驱逐”）。",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "收到良币（金属值钱） → 倾向收藏、熔化、输出国外、囤积（因为卖金属本身就能赚更多）。\n收到劣币（金属不值钱） → 尽快花出去（反正面值一样，用掉最划算）。\n结果：市场上只剩下劣币流通，良币消失（被“驱逐”）。",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "MKTZekRuSFSHk-05xYScp",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 86.00316972787076,
      "y": 354.3269482774649,
      "width": 85.27999877929688,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
