      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1771776188893,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "国家为分割\n印钞权 -> 免费获得资源",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "国家为分割\n印钞权 -> 免费获得资源",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "Id9eybp8Owupwxv1XevOH",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1011.5883783018879,
      "y": 250.09510337209989,
      "width": 370,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "dashed",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aj",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1345191126,
      "version": 77,
      "versionNonce": 1979389322,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1771776203553,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "例如，如果国家印钞买走国内一半粮食，粮食供给不变但货币增多，价格必然翻倍。\n结果：民众实际购买力下降（相当于国家通过通胀“偷”走部分财富）。",
      "fontSize": 10,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "例如，如果国家印钞买走国内一半粮食，粮食供给不变但货币增多，价格必然翻倍。\n结果：民众实际购买力下降（相当于国家通过通胀“偷”走部分财富）。",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "EkjiSSidtj1R0MhaqdJcS",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1657.7836097010643,
      "y": 185.959747958106,
      "width": 135,
      "height": 18.75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
